### MediCitas — RF20 agenda del día + RF21 conteo por estado
### Requiere: docker compose up

@host = http://localhost:8080
@kc = http://localhost:6767
@realm = medicitas
@client = api

### Token recepción norte
# @name tokenRecep
POST {{kc}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{client}}&username=recep-norte&password=recep123&grant_type=password

### Agenda del día (toda la clínica; I5 ignora clinicaId)
GET {{host}}/agenda?fecha=2026-11-12&clinicaId=clinica-sur
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}

### Agenda filtrada por profesional
GET {{host}}/agenda?fecha=2026-11-12&profesionalId={{profesionalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}

### Resumen por estado (mes)
GET {{host}}/citas/resumen?desde=2026-11-01&hasta=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}

### Token profesional (solo su agenda / su conteo)
# @name tokenProf
POST {{kc}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{client}}&username=dra-garcia&password={{$dotenv SEED_USER_PASSWORD}}&grant_type=password

GET {{host}}/agenda?fecha=2026-11-12
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenProf.response.body.access_token}}

### Profesional pidiendo otro profesionalId → 403
GET {{host}}/agenda?fecha=2026-11-12&profesionalId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenProf.response.body.access_token}}

GET {{host}}/citas/resumen?desde=2026-11-01&hasta=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenProf.response.body.access_token}}
